			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1784901709649,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Advantages\nEasy to understand\nSmall IDs\nNaturally ordered\nWorks well for small systems\n\nProblems\n\nEvery write depends on one database or counter.\nIt can become a bottleneck.\nIt can become a single point of failure.\nIt becomes difficult when data is split across many databases.",
			"rawText": "Advantages\nEasy to understand\nSmall IDs\nNaturally ordered\nWorks well for small systems\n\nProblems\n\nEvery write depends on one database or counter.\nIt can become a bottleneck.\nIt can become a single point of failure.\nIt becomes difficult when data is split across many databases.",
			"fontSize": 52.68800286652186,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Advantages\nEasy to understand\nSmall IDs\nNaturally ordered\nWorks well for small systems\n\nProblems\n\nEvery write depends on one database or counter.\nIt can become a bottleneck.\nIt can become a single point of failure.\nIt becomes difficult when data is split across many databases.",
