			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1784901709650,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Advantages:\n1. one place control uniqueness\n2. id can be short and ordered  \n3. Application server stay simple\n\nDisAdvantages\n1. Every Id need a network call\n2. service can be bottleneck\n3. running several service can be bottle-neck\n4. Clock rollback\n",
			"rawText": "Advantages:\n1. one place control uniqueness\n2. id can be short and ordered  \n3. Application server stay simple\n\nDisAdvantages\n1. Every Id need a network call\n2. service can be bottleneck\n3. running several service can be bottle-neck\n4. Clock rollback\n",
			"fontSize": 43.526260719187064,
